<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mixed.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mixed.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring wheat values and soft white bids were mixed but with a negative bias.</p>
<p>Movement in spring wheat was fairly light, one Minneapolis dealer said. But sales of soft white wheat picked up in parts of Oregon, another broker said. &quot;We bought a little bit today,&quot; one said.</p>
<p>Some of the winter wheat seeding is done in Pacific Northwest areas but rain hampered fieldwork in Montana, dealers said.</p>
<p>December MGE spring wheat futures firmed 1/2 cent to end at $4.07-1/2 a bushel.  </p>
